  "about": [
    "SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-W-2.0",
    "What KL_aecp_engine decodes and dispatches, observed by tb/aecp_cmds (issue #73). Regenerate with: make -C tb/aecp_cmds record. The suite holds a fresh sweep to this file; scripts/check_aecp_commands.py (make check) holds aecp_commands.json to it.",
    "decode: per message bucket, groups of opcodes the engine treats alike; per program (the E_<name> the uCPU was handed): floor = the shortest cdl it was dispatched at, cdls = every swept cdl it was dispatched at, answers = status code -> the response cdls seen ('echo' = always the command's own cdl). 'engine' = answered without a program.",
    "gdi: GET_DYNAMIC_INFO with one record of each command_type: members -> the program each record ran and the aggregate's status:record length (copied = a record answered by copying its data); refused -> the program that refused the whole command; empty -> the aggregate with no record.",
    "unsolicited: per job kind, the program and the response's command_type:cdl."
  ],
